<title>UK: Pakistan buys cargo of white sugar at $351/T-trade.</title>
<headline>Pakistan buys cargo of white sugar at $351/T-trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan bought one cargo of white sugar at the end of last week at $351 a tonne, London traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Details of the supplier and the shipment period have yet to emerge.</p>
<p>On Monday, Pakistan said it would decide on Wednesday the result of a tender to buy 50,000 tonnes of crystal whites, to reach Karachi in two equal shipments by June 20 and July 10. The tender was opened on Saturday.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
